db56b1033f3c6966cc93fa.png?v=2","chem-asset:861630d38831e07e528555a21fc78afa2661552c0dc9f1ddb060db739eb2baef:5;":"../../../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/e26b2ba71c127140f80400ea.png?v=2","chem-asset:da4f863bfee263cb92c1b81e5e560ea764c1c7a6724826b004a434a84648f9dc:6;":"../../../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/da4f863bfee263cb92c1b81e.png?v=2","chem-asset:e733dd09d1db8bbe5019fc6f947efe8cf8fd114bdf7f874622743b333153a9e3:7;":"../../../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/e733dd09d1db8bbe5019fc6f.png?v=2","chem-asset:121852a096b8e3b9e932e9e8001478a6ab8a232b7d929f56374e3bede695f101:8;":"../../../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/9deaa9d00caa5f1487a619fe.png?v=2","chem-asset:692610ac409767f3f10803d9f1abaad2989f5b797633ade4f66e7d43ddfa47c8:9;":"../../../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/72af02bfbfeef58d02004807.png?v=2","chem-asset:b2aa092611e02b13488a97879976b1be0eea29925b91d1b7d8ad657ac21c32ba:10;":"../../../../%E6%89%B9%E6%AC%A1%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95/2026.6.13/assets/b2aa092611e02b13488a9787.png?v=2"},"sourceSha256":"799d55ffae858b2ae2e9c8f1d08b79974a468f6095a27a1cb55c186fc191a63f","bom":false,"legacyPath":"化学反应原理/化学反应速率/活化能/基元反应与反应历程/P05-Q09_镍催化芳香酰胺醇解.html"},"2026.6.13:P05-Q13":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>难溶铅盐的溶解平衡图</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.6.13 · 长郡中学 · 第13题 · P05-Q13</div><h1>难溶铅盐的溶解平衡图</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/溶度积</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：利用对数浓度图求溶度积，判断沉淀次序和转化常数。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/沉淀溶解平衡/沉淀溶解平衡的应用</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡常数</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H~1  Li~7  C~12  O~16  S~32  Zn~65</p><p>13. 秦俑彩绘中使用的铅白(PbCO<sub>3</sub>)和黄金雨中黄色的PbI<sub>2</sub>都是难溶性铅盐涂料。室温下，PbCO<sub>3</sub>和PbI<sub>2</sub>在不同的溶液中分别达到溶解平衡时<img src=\"chem-asset:926fe7e8692d699716431380d2b85127b168b39acd78de278ffb53743fba030e:0;\" style=\"width:69.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与-lgc(<img src=\"chem-asset:7058774db162aeb16ca9b7d875ace5b7b6a4f916e3cdfb549a00e311b4b4bf53:1;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)或-lgc(I<sup>-</sup>)的关系如图所示。</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:e22524339a35beb950ccc445b23d6122c6345f63fd78399d9f6a855e8c39a840:2;\" style=\"width:300.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>下列说法正确的是</p><p>A. 曲线Ⅱ对应的是<img src=\"chem-asset:926fe7e8692d699716431380d2b85127b168b39acd78de278ffb53743fba030e:0;\" style=\"width:69.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:60e7b4320f855dc7c4800791ea984726c96fa96d5a36f70ab7ef63af7a15aff9:3;\" style=\"width:53.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的变化关系</p><p>B. a点PbCO<sub>3</sub>的结晶速率小于其溶解速率</p><p>C. 向浓度均为1mol/L的<img src=\"chem-asset:daf6a0e034e5caee6149628987d90fc60a01693303b8e2411eaecd8b2f02e4e6:4;\" style=\"width:96.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">混合溶液中滴入<img src=\"chem-asset:6b1d3486dc8e0bc682a31d2ace7b20cb89bc0ab4a3e908a5abfb6210e05894d2:5;\" style=\"width:72.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液先产生白色沉淀</p><p>D. 反应<img src=\"chem-asset:89bfb6ded5f5f6b41a66478dae492fd7e4af5e846034abdca66fe02eeeedff37:6;\" style=\"width:279.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡常数的数量级为10<sup>-6</sup></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】根据溶解平衡，PbCO<sub>3</sub>(s)⇌Pb<sup>2+</sup>(aq)+ <img src=\"chem-asset:5072e8aa1092dd1f06321db956bcabb9422a4e7222bc6e11dc2586d1204d9140:7;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(aq)，达到平衡时c(Pb<sup>2+</sup>)=c(<img src=\"chem-asset:5072e8aa1092dd1f06321db956bcabb9422a4e7222bc6e11dc2586d1204d9140:7;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)，则图象曲线II对应的是-lgc(Pb<sup>2+</sup>)与-lgc(<img src=\"chem-asset:5072e8aa1092dd1f06321db956bcabb9422a4e7222bc6e11dc2586d1204d9140:7;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)的关系变化；PbI<sub>2</sub>(s)⇌Pb<sup>2+</sup>(aq)+2I<sup>-</sup>(aq)，达平衡时2c(Pb<sup>2+</sup>)=c(I<sup>-</sup>)，图象曲线I对应的是-lgc(Pb<sup>2+</sup>)与-lgc(I<sup>-</sup>)的关系变化；</p><p>【详解】A．根据分析可知，曲线I对应的是<img src=\"chem-asset:926fe7e8692d699716431380d2b85127b168b39acd78de278ffb53743fba030e:0;\" style=\"width:69.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">与<img src=\"chem-asset:23bb22a7c855e582ba9b33dd6190c7cc004d573ce2fe541bf1cfb4acf21c0e5f:8;\" style=\"width:53.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的变化关系，A错误；</p><p>B．a点对应的Q(PbCO<sub>3</sub>)&gt;K<sub>sp</sub>(PbCO<sub>3</sub>)，结晶速率大于其溶解速率，B错误；</p><p>C．由图可知，K<sub>sp</sub>(PbCO<sub>3</sub>)= c(Pb<sup>2+</sup>)×c(<img src=\"chem-asset:5072e8aa1092dd1f06321db956bcabb9422a4e7222bc6e11dc2586d1204d9140:7;\" style=\"width:39.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">)=10<sup>0</sup>×10<sup>-13.1</sup>=10<sup>-13.1</sup>，K<sub>sp</sub>(PbI<sub>2</sub>)= c(Pb<sup>2+</sup>)×c<sup>2</sup>(I<sup>-</sup>)=10<sup>0</sup>×(10<sup>-4</sup>)<sup>2</sup>=10<sup>-8</sup>，1mol/L的<img src=\"chem-asset:daf6a0e034e5caee6149628987d90fc60a01693303b8e2411eaecd8b2f02e4e6:4;\" style=\"width:96.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">沉淀所需Pb<sup>2+</sup>浓度分别是<img src=\"chem-asset:ed70b3a35f5019ad070b77547cb69e75587800612a796b2ab1cdf9f7ba91a107:9;\" style=\"width:191.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:6ed90d913f9b181c87af95defb75ad2f45b78b7ec7c1f383fcfb21becd1adbac:10;\" style=\"width:75.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">mol/L，PbCO<sub>3</sub>先沉淀，先产生白色沉淀，C正确；</p><p>D．反应<img src=\"chem-asset:b4e2a8ef4027a2963222c8a5e3cba66f5fc018ecf62dbeb467fbc3b1c8413f21:11;\" style=\"width:258.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡常数K=<img src=\"chem-asset:6457c19d28830538c205497d6264e7a08802367579d842fbf065519fdfedce6d:12;\" style=\"width:263.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，数量级为10<sup>5</sup>，D错误；</p><p>答案选C。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">本页保存原卷答案与解析。知识点标签和分类依据为本次整理结果；未逐题独立重解或校订原解析。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期模拟卷二 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p class=\"source-path\">D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.6.13\\精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期模拟卷二 化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市长郡中学2026届高三下学期模拟卷二 化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.6.13/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%95%BF%E9%83%A1%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8B%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%20%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原 Word 文件</a></p><p class=\"muted\">原文定位：第13题。共享材料随整题保留，小问标签用于检索。</p></details></main></body></html>","assets":["23bb22a7c855e582ba9b33dd6190c7cc004d573ce2fe541bf1cfb4acf21c0e5f","5072e8aa1092dd1f06321db956bcabb9422a4e7222bc6e11dc2586d1204d9140","60e7b4320f855dc7c4800791ea984726c96fa96d5a36f70ab7ef63af7a15aff9","6457c19d28830538c205497d6264e7a08802367579d842fbf065519fdfedce6d","6b1d3486dc8e0bc682a31d2ace7b20cb89bc0ab4a3e908a5abfb6210e05894d2","6ed90d913f9b181c87af95defb75ad2f45b78b7ec7c1f383fcfb21becd1adbac","7058774db162aeb16ca9b7d875ace5b7b6a4f916e3cdfb549a00e311b4b4bf53","89bfb6ded5f5f6b41a66478dae492fd7e4af5e846034abdca66fe02eeeedff37","926fe7